Show the difference between primitive and reference types by creating a variable favFood = 'pizza' and another variable favFoodCopy = favFood. Change favFood to 'burger' and log both variables. Then, create an object zomatoUser with a property city, assign it to another variable, change the city in one, and log both objects.<br><br><em><strong>Hint:</strong> Observe how changes affect primitives vs objects.</em>

